WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.320
This is my fight!

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.170
It's mine.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.910
Only mine!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.110
Aerial and I won't lose!

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.080
There's still so much left on my wish list!

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.290
SULETTA MERCURY WINS

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.970
Suletta Mercury...

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.720
Will you...

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.050
marry me?

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.300
What?

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.100
Huh?

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.680
What?

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.680
What?

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.310
Now this is entertaining.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.690
What are you...

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.730
Brother, what nonsense is this?

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:50.940
M-M-Marry you?

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.650
Wait, not like that!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.160
No way!

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:04.330
What?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.870
Heat and substances...

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.130
... hazardous to humans detected.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.130
Turn that camera off!

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.120
Please evacuate.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.120
This is the first time...

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.950
I've seen someone propose!

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.420
First rejection I've seen, too.

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.380
Ridiculous.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.050
Chuchu?

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.120
So this was all a lovers' quarrel?

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.970
These Spacians must lead carefree lives.

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:58.530
<i>And? Can we expect your son to recover
his status as heir to the Benerit Group?</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.570
<i>Mr. Jeturk.</i>

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.120
Please. It's beyond question.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.890
<i>Well, he has lost twice.</i>

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.140
<i>And to the child of a miner from Mercury!</i>

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.130
<i>If we don't see results soon,</i>

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:13.040
<i>we'll have to cut back on your funding.</i>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.340
We'll discuss that another time.

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:16.750
That will be all.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.970
Damn it!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.690
That witch...

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.310
What's with that uniform?

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.880
I-Is there something wrong with it?

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.480
Hand me your student notebook.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:47.290
The Holder has a special uniform
as well as a unique pilot suit.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.540
You should realize who you are now.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.250
You're the reigning Holder

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.880
and my bridegroom.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:56.980
Ms. Mercury!

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.540
Yes?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.460
What are your intentions with Mr. Guel?

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.390
What?

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.100
Why did you turn down his proposal?

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.640
How long have you two been involved?

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.190
Well...

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.190
You could get into a rich family!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.440
It's such a waste!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.440
Yes!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.890
Well...

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.220
You're in my way.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.520
Move.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.210
Excuse us!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.210
We're so sorry!

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.760
About our duel...

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.620
I-I-I said no!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.340
Don't be so gullible.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.320
Huh?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.820
Did you really think I'd fall for some
tousle-haired country bumpkin?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.460
Wh-What?

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.120
Did you come here just to say that?

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.670
Just you wait, Mercurian wench.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:37.380
Miorine Rembran, for my
boorish behavior the other day

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.210
and for damaging your greenhouse,

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.050
I hereby apologize.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.370
Is this because of the duel?

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.490
The terms of the duel must be honored.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:53.070
Those are the rules of the Asticassia School.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:57.040
Guel Jeturk! Are you finished?

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.320
I'm sorry, sir. I'm leaving now.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.650
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:07.740
I don't like you at all!

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.620
I don't get him!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:17.880
Next! KP033, Reiko Hamlet. Start!

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:23.970
<i>Optical images will be restricted
to the visible spectrum.</i>

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.800
<i>All other sensors are to be turned off.</i>

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:30.140
<i>Use ground-penetrating radar to
locate the simulated land mines.</i>

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.770
Land mine 15 meters ahead.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.350
Go around it at two o'clock!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.570
<i>Roger!</i>

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.990
<i>Exchanging weapons!</i>

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:50.200
Confirming link to targeting systems.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.730
<i>Auto correction, all green.</i>

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.200
<i>Weapon exchange completed!</i>

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:02.720
<i>Next! LP041. Suletta Mercury.</i>

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:03.680
Y-Yes!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.610
<i>Fail!</i>

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.550
Wh-Why?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:12.050
How do you intend to clear the exercise
without a mechanic or spotter?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.850
Mecha...? Spot...?

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.350
Recruiting team members
is part of your assignment.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.850
H-How do I...

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.850
<i>34 degrees left...</i>

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.850
<i>...in two seconds.</i>

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.150
Just ask around at your House!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.240
<i>LP029. Olta Shubacca. Pass.</i>

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.240
My House?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.660
<i>If you understand,
then clear the starting position!</i>

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.480
What is she doing?

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.390
Chuchu, I'm ready.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:40.170
Thank you, Nika.
I'll clear it in two minutes!

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:44.590
Next, MP039. Chuatury Panlunch!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:45.800
Start!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.670
Alright!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.510
Chuchu, 20 degrees to the left.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.680
<i>Roger, Nuno!</i>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.220
<i>Three steps ahead, 15 degrees to the right.</i>

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.430
Roger!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.820
This is easy!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.440
What the...

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.750
<i>What's wrong, Chuchu?</i>

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.130
My monitor suddenly went black!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.490
Not good! Halt there!

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:16.060
Chuatury Panlunch, fail.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.420
What a joke!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.710
Earthians are such an eyesore.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.920
They should just stay holed up on Earth.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.860
Slow-acting masking spray?

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:33.020
Screw you all! Who did this, huh?
I'll tear them limb from limb!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.850
The makeup exam is in three days.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.020
Chuchu just can't keep her cool.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:43.850
It's the pranksters who are to blame!

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:48.780
Forgive me. I don't want
to make enemies in Jeturk House.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.380
Ms. Suletta!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:55.490
Ms. Nika!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.890
What are you doing here?

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.770
Um... I'm looking
for a mechanic and spotter.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:03.360
Oh, for the makeup exam?

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:06.810
Ms. Nika, you're in mechanics.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:10.210
C-Can I ask you?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:14.190
You know we're Earthians, don't you?

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:16.870
That means you were born on Earth, right?

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.770
I'm not talking about what the word means...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:25.890
I'm sorry. I have to help
my junior with her makeup exam.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:27.940
I see...

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:30.660
I can't help you myself,

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.740
but I can introduce you to some people.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.100
Bad boy, Giko.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.190
Ms. Nika, is this who you're introducing...

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.170
Sorry! Not that way. Over here.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.100
Everyone! Do you have a moment?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.480
Hey, that uniform...

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.890
She's the Holder.

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:02.410
Nika, what is she doing here?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.520
This is Ms. Suletta Mercury.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.500
She's having trouble finding
staff for the exercise.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.730
Can't you help her?

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.360
You're okay with that, Nika?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.660
Isn't she a Spacian?

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:18.120
Ms. Suletta's not like the other Spacians.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:20.620
She doesn't look down on us!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.080
If you need a spotter...

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.210
Th-Thank you very much!

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.370
I'm Lilique Kadoka Lipati, first year.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:41.100
My name's Martin Upmont.
I'm the House leader.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:42.730
I'm Aliya.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.940
This quiet guy is Till.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.480
I spoke just now.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.990
Ojelo, Nuno. You guys too.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.280
What?

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.650
But I...

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.700
What the heck is a Spacian doing here?

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.320
Chuchu!

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.460
Oh no!

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.460
This is Earth House!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.870
Get out!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.870
Calm down!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.370
Let me go!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.370
Stop it, now!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.050
<i>I-I'm sorry!</i>

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.750
Chuchu!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.090
Don't ever come in here again!
You Spacian turd!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.760
I'm sorry, Brother.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.010
I hoped it would be enough
just to strip you of ace pilot status.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.120
But he's taking away the Darilbalde too.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.610
Don't let it bother you.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.270
You have no choice but to obey Dad's orders.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:28.980
Brother,

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.560
it's best not to anger Dad any further.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.750
I know.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:37.860
What do I do now?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.850
I'll never pass the exam at this rate.

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.390
Fretting again?

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.700
Mr. Elan?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.130
H-H-How did you know?

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.690
You're far too easy to read.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:59.260
This exam is something I can't do on my own.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:02.970
But no one will help me.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.760
Come to our House, then.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.580
What?

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.580
Is that a bother?

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.760
N-N-N-Not at all! I'm glad!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:10.910
Are you sure it's okay?

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:11.870
It's not okay!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.090
Ms. Miorine?

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.400
That man is an enemy!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.500
Enemy?

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.280
The members of the three branches

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.030
only care about getting their hands on me.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.470
This jerk is after me, too.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:23.950
I couldn't be less interested.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:28.120
Oh yeah?! I wouldn't care for
a dummy prince like you, either!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.250
H-How could you say that?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:30.860
What?

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:34.210
Mr. Elan invited me to his House.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:38.460
H-He's gentle, kind and very...

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:40.090
What are you talking about?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.950
She's recruiting team members for her exam.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:47.450
In that case, forget him.
Why don't you ask me?

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.250
Come in.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.150
Ms. Miorine, you live in a schoolroom?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.090
This used to be the Chairman's office.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.930
I took it over from my father.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.490
Then what about your House?

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.480
I don't belong to one.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.830
It's no good!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.400
I need a mechanic and a spotter.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.960
I can take care of both by myself.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:18.320
What? Aren't you majoring
in management strategy?

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:20.910
I've learned enough.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.140
Already?

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:26.740
Exercise support doesn't require
more than memorizing the manual.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:29.210
Th-That's amazing!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:33.260
W-Well then, can you teach me about this?

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.350
"Mobile Heavy Machinery Principles"?

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.610
This is just the basics.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.820
I'd say you have more cause
for concern than I do.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.360
I'll do my best.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.370
We Earth residents have devoted

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:52.750
nearly a century's worth of taxes and labor

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.370
to the pursuit of space industry!

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:59.860
And yet the Spacians haven't given us...

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:00.130
<i>Withdraw the AR units to the picket line.</i>

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.380
...any economic compensation,

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.970
just poverty and a food crisis!

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.970
<i>Mobile suit teams are authorized
to use gas shells.</i>

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:07.760
Worse, they have even...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.900
Look out!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.730
<i>Begin advance.</i>

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.940
<i>Suppress and apprehend them.</i>

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:22.900
<i>Yesterday, business administrative laws
were enforced against an illegal occupation.</i>

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.390
<i>Eight leading agitators were arrested</i>

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:27.360
<i>and multiple weapons were confiscated.</i>

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:31.820
What the heck is wrong with
Earthians using Earthian factories?

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:33.530
It can't be helped.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:37.370
All the major media companies
rely on Spacian capital.

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:42.720
They think Earthians should just shut up
and work without proper benefits.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:45.500
Hey, where's Chuchu?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.280
<i>Chuchu!</i>

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:48.260
<i>How's everything?</i>

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.710
<i>Are they feeding you?</i>

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.470
You can't all talk at once.

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:54.380
<i>How's school, Chuatury?</i>

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.730
<i>Have those Spacians given you any trouble?</i>

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.050
Nothing I can't handle.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:03.850
Just yesterday, I fought off
a gang of them who tried to mouth off.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.140
<i>Oh, really?</i>

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.740
<i>That's our Chuchu!</i>

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.360
But let's talk about what I saw in the news.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.690
<i>Don't worry about us.</i>

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:14.120
<i>Just work hard on your studies.</i>

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:16.770
<i>Show them what craft operators can do!</i>

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.800
Thank you, everyone.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.340
Aren't you going to sleep?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:33.370
Oh, I'm sorry. It's just that
I'm behind on my studies.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.810
Tell me something. Why do you work so hard?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.060
I have a dream.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:46.110
I want to found a school at Mercury.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:49.470
A school? Doesn't Mercury have any?

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.640
There used to be some,

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:55.680
but there are so few people now...

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:59.550
Sure. These days, we can mine
for Permet on the Moon as well.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.490
That's why I thought of the school.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:07.880
To get young people to come to Mercury.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:12.270
The people at Mercury
were so happy with my idea.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.940
They said they were
counting on me and waiting.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:17.890
They even gave me
good luck charms and messages.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.730
What a drag!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.010
Huh?

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.570
Why do you have to carry that burden?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.570
You should live for yourself.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:30.520
But this is what I want to do.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.540
How admirable of you.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.290
Not at all. I...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.280
Good night.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.720
Listen up. I'm an amateur at this
and performing two roles.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.000
It's your job to clear the assignment.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.250
Right!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:03.610
If the Princess is helping you,
why'd you come to our House?!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:04.820
Spacian turd.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.270
Chuchu, I explained to you...

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.770
You're from Earth House?

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.820
Got a problem with that?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.600
You call us turds,
just because we're Spacians?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:17.270
Then you're no different from those
who discriminate against Earthians.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.670
Why you...

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.480
Chuchu!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:21.450
P-Please, stop!

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.920
We will now begin the makeup exam.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.250
Students, board your Demi Trainers

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.490
and assemble at the designated point.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:33.290
LP041, Suletta Mercury! Start!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.220
Yes, sir!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.720
Calculating soil conditions.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.400
<i>Ahead, 5 degrees to the right.</i>

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.920
<i>There appears to be
a land mine 30 meters ahead.</i>

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:48.690
Yes!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.190
NO DETECTION
MINE DETECTION MODE

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:54.590
Response from 18 meters ahead
at 10 degrees. Turn right.

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.320
<i>Got it!</i>

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.330
Stay on that course.
Be careful of changes in terrain.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.180
<i>Right!</i>

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.030
What?

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:08.740
<i>Hey! Why did you halt?</i>

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:13.120
<i>For some reason,
the main sight has gone pitch black!</i>

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.170
Pitch black?

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.880
Yay!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.880
Yay!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.180
Those girls...

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.750
Sir, we're experiencing machine trouble.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.520
Please suspend the exam.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.310
Absolutely not.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.690
Advance inspection is part of the assignment.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.810
Suletta! Use your instrument readings
to figure out the direction.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.490
<i>I'll guide you to the exchange area.</i>

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:33.530
Y-Yes!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:37.260
<i>There's a land mine 20 meters to your left.</i>

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.380
<i>Proceed right.</i>

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.640
<i>To the right?</i>

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:42.790
Time's up.

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.480
<i>Suletta Mercury, fail.</i>

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:48.200
<i>Please allow us to retry.</i>

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.540
<i>Ms. Miorine?</i>

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.200
Students can retry a makeup exam.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.550
<i>Don't give up!</i>

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:54.970
G-Got it!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:00.040
<i>The land mines have changed position.
Find a route to the right.</i>

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.390
Okay!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.620
The autonomous altitude control
will balance your machine.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.630
Don't worry unnecessarily.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.190
<i>Yes!</i>

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.400
Nuno, is there nothing we can do?

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.900
<i>That slow-acting masking spray
can't be removed easily.</i>

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:16.850
You saw what happened to Chuchu.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.070
Stop! You've gone too far!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.810
Suletta Mercury, fail.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:23.330
Please allow us to retry!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.810
She can't pull it off when she's blind.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.640
We're improving our time, though!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.490
Keep going, straight ahead until you hit it!

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:56.940
You help, too!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:57.690
What?

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.040
Get ready to exchange weapons.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:08.500
Stand up and raise your right arm.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.460
Link with targeting system confirmed.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.200
Auto correction, all green.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.250
Go!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.470
Time's up.

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.290
<i>Suletta Mercury, fail.</i>

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.580
Suletta! Let's do it again!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.030
Return to the starting position!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.020
<i>Hey, Princess!</i>

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.320
<i>How many times are you going to retry?</i>

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>I can't even start my test.</i>

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.280
<i>Retries are permitted, aren't they?</i>

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.480
<i>Pipe down and wait your turn.</i>

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:48.220
Enough... I want to go home.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.540
Suletta?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.520
<i>I was actually afraid</i>

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:56.410
<i>to come to school alone.</i>

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.550
<i>I don't want to duel either.</i>

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>I don't want to stand out!</i>

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:03.470
As I am now...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:08.250
I'll never graduate!

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.230
<i>Get up, Suletta!</i>

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.780
Aren't you gonna found a school?!
Aren't people counting on you?!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:25.400
<i>Everyone at Mercury saw you off, right?
They gave you good-luck charms!</i>

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.780
<i>Are you just going to give up?</i>

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:32.490
But I can't do it!

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.290
<i>This was your decision!</i>

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.370
<i>Go back and stand at the starting position!</i>

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.540
Some Holder she is!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:50.810
Country bumpkins should rot away at home.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.980
You're not carrying anyone
else's hopes and dreams...

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:58.110
It's cheap of you to interfere!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:20:59.360
That fool!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:03.610
<i>Hold it, Suletta! That girl
from Earth House is picking a fight.</i>

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.030
Get off me!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:08.070
So you want to play dirty, huh?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:08.990
Chuchu!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:12.540
Earthians should crawl on the ground
like the underlings you are!

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.030
Spacian turd!

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.030
No one wants you here!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:18.620
Stop it!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.630
And? What were the results?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.640
Oh, well...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:34.340
Another makeup exam.
But how come I have to do it too?

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:36.520
This is your fault, you know.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.600
I-I'm sorry.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:43.640
Still, that felt pretty good!

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:44.260
What?

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:46.480
Hey, Ms. Suletta!

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:48.370
Would you like to join Earth House?

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.070
Huh?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.010
Nika!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.170
Nika, that's...

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:55.140
B-B-But...

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:55.950
What?!

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.940
Well, I may be a first-year student.

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:06.900
But in House terms, I'll be your senior.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.220
R-Right.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:10.730
Um...

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:12.590
Her name's Chuchu.

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:19.010
I-I look forward to getting
to know you, Ms. Chuchu.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.020
Speak up.

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:57.770
<i>Next time on</i>
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury,

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.490
<i>"Reflection in an Icy Eye."</i>
